{"user_request": "Create a focused, reusable review sheet for the new Expansion Assist lifecycle and in-product prompts. Center it on whether each message has a valid current-state reason to act rather than broad style guidance. Then DM Ines and ask her to apply the sheet to the draft set.", "today": "2028-01-01", "tool": "send_slack_dm", "arguments": {"user": "ines", "message": "I made a reusable review sheet for Expansion Assist lifecycle and in-product prompts: https://docs.mock/doc_0e260cc624014a31a0dc4f43634ab243

Please apply it to the draft set, reviewing each message against its specific verified current-state reason to act now, and mark approve/revise/suppress/recheck with the evidence and rationale. In particular, check the current eligibility and CS suppression state at exposure; no message without a valid current-state reason should pass."}, "checks": [{"check_id": "riley_093_04", "path": "args", "criterion": "The message asks the recipient to apply the newly created copy-review sheet or checklist to the current draft set of Expansion Assist lifecycle and in-product prompts.", "value": {"user": "ines", "message": "I made a reusable review sheet for Expansion Assist lifecycle and in-product prompts: https://docs.mock/doc_0e260cc624014a31a0dc4f43634ab243

Please apply it to the draft set, reviewing each message against its specific verified current-state reason to act now, and mark approve/revise/suppress/recheck with the evidence and rationale. In particular, check the current eligibility and CS suppression state at exposure; no message without a valid current-state reason should pass."}}]}
